(table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Normalization removes redundancy from a relational database design by splitting data) Tj T*
(into well structured tables. Designers draw an ER diagram of each entity before creating) Tj T*
(the schema in the DBMS.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SQL is the language used to query a relational database. The SELECT statement retrieves) Tj T*
(records, and a JOIN combines records from several tables using their keys.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
